            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Psychological stress and chronic anxious behavior have a tremendous impact on our heart and biological rhythm of the body. Both are responsible for new development or promotion of coronary heart disease and may be associated with unpredictable adverse coronary events.</AbstractText>
